OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies in moped crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA teenager has died and a boy has been
OL,6,Fcritically injured after a moped crash,
OL,7,FKent Police have said.
OL,9,FThe force said officers approached two
OL,10,Fpeople on a moped on foot in Beach
OL,11,FStreet at about 19:50 GMT on Saturday
OL,12,Fbefore it left the scene and crashed in
OL,13,Fa nearby alleyway.
OL,15,FAn 18-year-old man was pronounced dead
OL,16,Fat the scene and the 16-year-old
OL,17,Fpassenger remains in a critical
OL,18,Fcondition in a London hospital.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
